l":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-01T20:17:02Z","updated_at":"2021-09-01T20:19:20Z","body":"> ```diff\r\n>    if (enter) {\r\n>      win_enter(wp, false);\r\n>    }\r\n> +  if (win_valid(wp) && buffer > 0) {\r\n> +    win_set_buf(wp->handle, buffer, fconfig.noautocmd, err);\r\n> +  }\r\n>    if (!win_valid(wp)) {\r\n>      api_set_error(err, kErrorTypeException, \"Window was closed immediately\");\r\n>      return 0;\r\n>    }\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nwhy are we doing win_enter() _before_ checking win_valid() ?\r\n\r\nperhaps also need to check nvim_buf_is_valid().\r\n\r\nand... `:help dev-api` , and numerous API functions give `del` as the conventional verb, but `nvim_buf_delete` does not use it ;_;","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/910698351/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j